  "aiContextParagraph": "Minister of Home Affairs Tito Karnavian has officially voiced his support for the TUNAS program, an initiative designed to safeguard children from the potential risks associated with digital technology. The government frames this effort as a critical component in preparing high-quality human resources as the nation works toward its development vision of Indonesia Emas 2045. By implementing measures to improve digital protection for younger generations, authorities intend to foster a safer online environment. This recent endorsement follows prior public statements from the Minister highlighting the importance of securing online spaces and ensuring digital safety. The initiative aligns with ongoing governmental efforts to address the challenges presented by the digital era while ensuring the development and well-being of the youth are protected as part of a broader national strategy for future human capital excellence.",
